The following matters shall be determined by the Board of Directors:
1. Organizational Regulations of the Corporation;
2. Annual business guidelines;
3. Establishment, modification, or dissolution of domestic and overseas branches;
4. Pricing of tobacco and liquor, and the commission for retailers;
5. Appointment and dismissal of the General Manager and Deputy General Managers;
6. Personnel regulations of the Corporation; and
7. Materials management regulations of the Corporation.
